abstract: >-
  Reference specification and zero-dependency Python 3 offline verifiers for {^} Protocol One:
  the AI Index Page v3 (C0–C4 Completeness Standard), the {^} 3-Byte ASCII Digital Corporate Mark
  (U+007B U+005E U+007D), and the 5-Layer Human Intent Verification Architecture (L1 Tri-Signature,
  L2 DocLock 1.5, L3 Alfa Code, L4 CryptoLock + CLK-ATTEST-1, and L5 G.A.I.L. — "The AI reads the
  proof; it is never the proof."). Commercial offline GUI studios and enterprise playbooks are
  available at https://protocolone.store.
